    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d608">

                <pb facs="0635" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg519"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.51/413.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Davis to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 23, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to your August 12. Dutch boat arrived yesterday. No gourdes aboard.
                    Representative of Banknote Company has just been in to show me a cable from New
                    York saying that no more shipping until advised by him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
